{"id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-variety.md","title":"Variety","display":"df-variety — Variety","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-variety","aliases":["93-df-variety"],"display":"df-variety — Variety","depends_on":["[[93-df-equational-class]]","[[93-df-closure-operators]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-variety"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-variety</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-variety — Variety"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"55094a403a51c25e\" href=\"?note=55094a403a51c25e\" title=\"93-df-equational-class\">93-df-equational-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> are class candidates, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55094a403a51c25e\" href=\"?note=55094a403a51c25e\" title=\"93-df-equational-class\">93-df-equational-class</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\\)</span> and the generated-variety operator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}(\\mathcal V,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}(\\mathcal V,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal V:\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathcal V\\land\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal V:\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathcal V\\land\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Variety is an exact alias of equational class, while the intersection formula separately defines the least variety containing a class. The name <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\\)</span> is deliberately distinct from the variable set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-equational-class","status":"resolved","id":"55094a403a51c25e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-equational-class]]","embed":fal